{"ticker":"GREENPANEL","symbol":"GREENPANEL","instrumentId":3161736,"name":"Greenpanel Ind.","industry":"NSE-Bldg-Wood Prds","about":"Greenpanel Industries is India’s leading wood panel manufacturer, specializing in medium-density fibreboard (MDF), plywood, veneers, and flooring solutions. With two advanced manufacturing facilities in Uttarakhand and Andhra Pradesh, Greenpanel produces high-quality, eco-friendly wood panels that cater to residential, commercial, and industrial needs. The company’s products are used in furniture, cabinetry, flooring, and interior decor, supporting builders, architects, and homeowners. Greenpanel’s focus on sustainability is reflected in its use of plantation wood and eco-conscious manufacturing practices. With a strong domestic presence and exports to over 60 countries, Greenpanel is renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.","website":"www.greenpanel.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:23:55.839Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":155.65,"changePct":0.5880832363965338,"week52High":268.1,"week52Low":124.5},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,909 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,577 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"56,408,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"54"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"32,549,156"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.32%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.41"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"21.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.19"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.11"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"157.22"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"16–445"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"-2.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"9.07"},{"label":"Volume","value":"124,761"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"334,549"},{"label":"Master score","value":"48"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"28"},{"label":"Price strength","v